head sgi-mgras-si-t
# ivview's textured quad on SI+T, from the IRIX 6.5.30 session run
# irix-20260930T224203-2e96c4 (four-node Origin 2000, the IP27GR532
# libGLcore.so, the scene's Texture2 image 4 2 4 with textureQuality 0.1,
# so the client kept one RGBA4 level drawn nearest; trace texrgba2.trace,
# SHA-256 c3f079d31f637d7c0db7852431b17fa3d64daf893a6be2250cfb9076811886cf).
# Kept: the context switch into ivview's slot 0x5420 (seq 3826921, in the
# handshake gl-pixels-rectwrite.replay uses around the captured 63-word
# image), then every main-port and source-mapping-port word from the
# bank token (seq 3827011) to glFlush (seq 3827622), the HQ flag writes
# and clears, and the one query's flag and answer reads. Dropped: status
# polls, interrupt and cursor traffic.
#
# Three things are not in the trace and are added:
#
# - Slot 3's control word, 0x190000 (DMA from widget 9), which the kernel
#   wrote before the trace began; it rewrites the same value at seq
#   3827469 and 3828757.
# - Two 'dma' records the model never read in that run, since it did not
#   take the load: the page-list entry and the level's 32 host bytes, read
#   over HMP while ivview ran (guest-memory-reads.txt, SHA-256
#   ecc43b7d74aca6f43a3c476013285ee541083afea21106c9bf877784c3fa2f1d).
# - The capture's page list and page are on node 1 (list at 0x10134c018,
#   frame 0x103267), and this head has one node, so both move to node 0:
#   the slot's base word 0x10134c019 becomes 0x134c019 and the entry
#   0x103267 becomes 0x3267. Nothing else is changed.
#
# Expected, under the model's choice of truncating an 8-bit component to
# 4 bits and widening it by replication (hw/misc/sgi-mgras-texture.c):
# every texel, R 0x10 + i, G 0x40 + i, B 0x80 + i, is (1, 4, 8) of 15, so
# the quad is 0x114488 modulated by white, and no pixel of it is white.
# The window's lower-left pixel is screen (94, 480) from the bottom, so
# window (x, y) is screen (94 + x, 543 - y).
read 4 0x008000 0x0
write 4 0x011000 0x0
